# CODEOWNERS — required reviewers for security-sensitive paths (CHG-04)
# Adjust paths to this repo's layout and replace the team handles.

# Authentication, authorization, sessions, crypto
**/auth/**            @security-team
**/middleware/auth*   @security-team
**/crypto/**          @security-team
**/security/**        @security-team

# Data models and migrations
**/migrations/**      @security-team @platform-team
**/models/**          @platform-team
**/schema/**          @platform-team

# CI, build, release
.github/**            @security-team @platform-team
.gitlab-ci.yml        @security-team @platform-team
Dockerfile*           @platform-team
docker-compose*.yml   @platform-team

# Infrastructure
infra/**              @platform-team @security-team
terraform/**          @platform-team @security-team
**/*.tf               @platform-team @security-team
k8s/**                @platform-team

# Compliance records
.soc2/**              @security-team
docs/policies/**      @security-team
SECURITY.md           @security-team
